{
  "id": "agentMemorySummaryViews",
  "name": "Hand-off packet and weekly digest with summary views (Redis Agent Memory)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Human-readable summaries, on demand\n\nThe best bot-to-human hand-off templates on n8n.io still have the human type the summary, and \"what did the agent learn this week\" digests are built from dozens of nodes. A **summary view** is a standing summary the server keeps over long-term memories, one per user, so both become a few nodes.\n\n**Set up once** creates the view `customer-briefing`, grouped by user, refreshed on demand.\n\n**Hand-off packet**: `POST /webhook/handoff` with `{ \"userId\": \"demo-user\" }` refreshes that user's briefing, waits for it, and answers with the text, ready for a Zendesk or HubSpot note.\n\n**Weekly digest**: every Monday, refresh every briefing, then read one per known user and compose a Markdown digest. Connect Slack or Gmail after **Weekly digest**.\n\nTry it:\n1. Select your **Redis Agent Memory API** credential on every Redis node.\n2. Run **Set up once**.\n3. Chat with any agent example in this folder as `demo-user`, then call the hand-off webhook.\n\nSummary views must be enabled on the store. The view is looked up by name so the example runs without pasting IDs; in production the **View** field offers the store's views in a list.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -820,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "setup-trigger",
      "name": "Set up once",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "summaryView",
        "operation": "create",
        "name": "customer-briefing",
        "groupBy": [
          "ownerId"
        ],
        "outputFormat": "TEXT",
        "instructions": "Write a briefing for a human agent taking over this customer: who they are, their preferences, open issues and anything they asked for. Plain prose, under 150 words. Say so if little is known.",
        "refreshMode": "MANUAL",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "create-view",
      "name": "Create the briefing view",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "handoff",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "handoff-webhook",
      "name": "Escalation request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "8d3a1e5c-4b8f-4a0d-c3e9-1f2a4b5c6d03"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "summaryView",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "id": "find-views",
      "name": "Find views",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "by-name",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "rightValue": "customer-briefing",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pick-view",
      "name": "Pick customer-briefing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "summaryView",
        "operation": "refresh",
        "viewId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.viewId }}"
        },
        "target": "PARTITION",
        "group": {
          "ownerId": "={{ $('Escalation request').item.json.body.userId }}"
        },
        "waitForResult": true,
        "maxWaitSeconds": 90
      },
      "id": "refresh-briefing",
      "name": "Refresh this customer's briefing",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "p-user",
              "name": "userId",
              "value": "={{ $('Escalation request').item.json.body.userId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-briefing",
              "name": "briefing",
              "value": "={{ $json.text ?? 'Nothing is known about this customer yet.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-count",
              "name": "memoriesSummarized",
              "value": "={{ $json.summarizedMemoryCount ?? 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-computed",
              "name": "computedAt",
              "value": "={{ $json.computedAt ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "handoff-packet",
      "name": "Hand-off packet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "firstIncomingItem",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-packet",
      "name": "Respond with the packet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "weekly-trigger",
      "name": "Every Monday at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "summaryView",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "id": "find-views-weekly",
      "name": "Find views (weekly)",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "by-name-weekly",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "rightValue": "customer-briefing",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pick-view-weekly",
      "name": "Pick customer-briefing (weekly)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "summaryView",
        "operation": "refresh",
        "viewId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.viewId }}"
        },
        "target": "FULL"
      },
      "id": "refresh-all",
      "name": "Refresh every briefing",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "session",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {}
      },
      "id": "list-sessions",
      "name": "List sessions",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-owner",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ownerId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "known-users",
      "name": "Known users only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "ownerId",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "one-per-user",
      "name": "One item per user",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "summaryView",
        "operation": "getResult",
        "viewId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Pick customer-briefing (weekly)').first().json.viewId }}"
        },
        "group": {
          "ownerId": "={{ $json.ownerId }}"
        },
        "waitForResult": true,
        "maxWaitSeconds": 120,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "read-briefing",
      "name": "Read the user's briefing",
      "type": "@redis/n8n-nodes-agent-memory.redisAgentMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
